  "description": "Over the years, we've tested many e-bikes, but none truly captivated our team.\nIt took time to determine the ideal bike for NS. We realized that besides the motor, geometry and suspension are key. We sought a geometry that suits motor-assisted bikes, not a copy of our \"analog\" products. All that complemented by the suspension for a heavier bike, aggressive tires, powerful brakes, and cockpit with a \"moto\" feel.\nWe believe that with E-FINE, we completed our goals.\nMAIN FEATURES\n- Shimano EP801 drive unit\n- integrated Shimano high-capacity battery\n- Progressive geometry with 44 mm fork rake\n- 170mm front / 160mm rear travel\n- Rock Shox Domain fork with 38mm stanchions\n- Rock Shox Super Deluxe Coil Select shock\n- Race Face Aeffect dropper post\n- Shimano Deore 1x12 drivetrain\n- Shimano Deore 4-piston brakes\n- Aggressive Maxxis tires\nTough alloy frame with double pass welds\n630Wh integrated battery, removable\n170mm front / 160mm rear travel\n63,8° head tube angle",
